 (successFlag msg)←##.Cider.PerformConfigChecks ∆GetConfigForChecks'packages_dev,packages_dev_2'
 →T.PassesIf 0≡successFlag
 →T.PassesIf 0<≢msg

 r←T._OK
⍝Done
